"></div><div id="fusion-static-enter:0fFVbpnkQrs" style="display:none" data-fusion-component="0fFVbpnkQrs"></div><div class="ads-box-cont flex items-center flex-col justify-center w-full   no-mobile no-row-2-mobile"><div class="content_gpt_lateralr"><div id="gpt_lateralr" class="flex justify-center"></div></div></div><div id="fusion-static-exit:0fFVbpnkQrs" style="display:none" data-fusion-component="0fFVbpnkQrs"></div></div></div></div><script id="fusion-metadata" type="application/javascript">window.Fusion=window.Fusion||{};Fusion.arcSite="diariocorreo";Fusion.contextPath="/pf";Fusion.mxId="00000000";Fusion.deployment="4971";Fusion.globalContent={};Fusion.globalContentConfig={};Fusion.lastModified=1792872330768;Fusion.contentCache={"story-feed-by-section":{"{\"feedOffset\":0,\"section\":\"\",\"stories_qty\":20}":{"data":{"type":"results","version":"0.6.0","content_elements":[{"content_elements":[{"_id":"TU6TADOUSFHR7ACQCYQKCHUNT4","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"<b>En coordinación con la ciudadanía, la Gerencia de Seguridad Ciudadana de la Municipalidad Distrital de La Esperanza ha mapeado 80 sectores para priorizar y fortalecer la vigilancia.</b>"},{"_id":"4YRJLU4CWZGZ3GUMC6D263U5SY","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"Los serenos recorren estos puntos y registran las intervenciones mediante los denominados cuadernos de presencia, los mismos que permiten dar seguimiento al trabajo desplegado en cada zona y tener estadísticas de las incidencias."},{"_id":"QNVZIBZLDJBAVHPZG77UAKD65Y","additional_properties":{},"type":"text","content":"En ese sentido, las autoridades ediles invitaron a otros pobladores a involucrarse en esta iniciativa, implementar sus organizaciones vecinales y colaborar con el personal de seguridad."},{"_id":"M2WTOMZN2NBJRJ4LNXJEIBWFOI","type":"raw_html","content":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(37,211,102,0.15);\">\n\n  <!-- FRANJA SUPERIOR -->\n  <div style=\"background: #25D366; padding: 6px 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    <span style=\"width: 7px; height: 7px; background: white; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; animation: pulsoW 0.8s infinite;\"></span>\n    <span style=\"color: white; font-size: 0.6em; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Canal oficial de WhatsApp</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- CUERPO -->\n  <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a1f0a 0%, #0d0d0d 100%); padding: 20px;\">\n    <a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb7TiRS9cDDcPrLTPY0z\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px;\">\n\n      <!-- ÍCONO -->\n      <div style=\"position: relative; flex-shrink: 0;\">\n        <div style=\"background: #25D366; width: 62px; height: 62px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 2em; box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(37,211,102,0.4); animation: ringW 2s infinite;\">📲</div>\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; bottom: 0; right: 0; background: #128C7E; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #0d0d0d; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.55em; color: white; font-weight: bold;\">✓</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- TEXTO -->\n      <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n        <p style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 0.58em; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 5px 0; font-weight: bold;\">Diario Correo</p>\n        <p style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 1em; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 0 6px 0; line-height: 1.3;\">Síguenos en WhatsApp y recibe las noticias al instante</p>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n          <span style=\"background: #25D366; color: white; font-size: 0.6em; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px; letter-spacing: 1px;\">UNIRME AL CANAL →</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- FRANJA INFERIOR -->\n  <div style=\"background: #0a1a0a; padding: 8px 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(37,211,102,0.15); text-align: center;\">\n    <span style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); font-size: 0.6em; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;\">📍 Noticias · Política · Mundo· Actualidad</span>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n@keyframes pulsoW { 0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)} 50%{opacity:0.3;transform:scale(0.6)} }\n@keyframes ringW { 0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(37,211,102,0.4)} 70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 14px rgba(37,211,102,0)} 100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(37,211,102,0)} }\n</style>\n"},{"level":2,"_id":"PCSGA6RV3VBA3DWMK6DESW76UM","additional_properties":{},"type":"header","content":"<mark class=\"hl_yellow\"><u><b>LE PUEDE INTERESAR</b></u></mark>"},{"list_type":"unordered","_id":"PAAS46CQ3VCOHIU2PDXVIY5GF4","type":"list","items":[{"_id":"OOU7AMXUO5C7JEBHRCXQI6E744","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://diariocorreo.pe/edicion/la-libertad/el-nino-golpearia-a-la-libertad-en-diciembre-noticia/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"\" title=\"https://diariocorreo.pe/edicion/la-libertad/el-nino-golpearia-a-la-libertad-en-diciembre-noticia/\"><i><b>El Niño golpearía a La Libertad en diciembre</b></i></a>"},{"_id":"MCOTP6LI7ZGCTKCKEZJZL5RMJA","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignment":"left","type":"text","content":"<a href=\"https://diariocorreo.pe/edicion/la-libertad/alcalde-de-trujillo-asegura-que-le-estan-corrigiendo-la-plana-a-arturo-fernandez-noticia/\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"\" title=\"https://diariocorreo.pe/edicion/la-libertad/alcalde-de-trujillo-asegura-que-le-estan-corrigiendo-la-plana-a-arturo-fernandez-noticia/\"><i><b>Alcalde de Trujillo asegura que le están corrigiendo la plana a Arturo Fernández</b></i></a>"},{"_id":"5SFHWFEF6RHMNEC3C2ZXI7Q2I4","additional_properties":{"indent":0},"alignm